  <TutoImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 6957082991898076456, guid: ada4bf4fc2b24c749b17c30c3fee775d, type: 3}
  <TutoText>k__BackingField: "As if zombies weren\u2019t enough, here comes the witch
    !\r\nShe doesn\u2019t bother to take the front door and directly comes through
    the roof. Unlike the zombies, she doesn\u2019t wander around in the manor and
    only targets you when she sees you.\r\nHer line of sight is only straight lines.
    Once you enter her line of sight, she\u2019ll prepare to run over you the next
    turn, ignoring everything in her way besides walls !"
